THIRD-PARTY WORK BUILT UPON

The segmentation backbone follows the lightweight U2-Net architecture of
Qin et al., "U2-Net: Going Deeper with Nested U-Structure for Salient Object
Detection", Pattern Recognition, 2020. The implementation in u2nete/models/ was
written for this project; see docs/METHODS.md for what was reused and what was
changed.
